00:00:19.989 --> 00:00:28.032
Bois Bélo was the closest point to Paris reached by the German army during its last lightning offensive in the spring of 1918.

00:00:30.068 --> 00:00:30.428
From,

00:00:31.048 --> 00:00:32.950
We are here in American territory.

00:00:45.017 --> 00:00:47.519
