00:00:48.179 --> 00:00:56.024
The American marines wrote their legend by retaking this wood after three weeks of fierce battle and at the cost of 7000 losses.

00:00:58.923 --> 00:01:00.384
They will keep the nickname of

00:01:00.745 --> 00:01:01.445
"Devil Dogs"

00:01:02.164 --> 00:01:02.285
Or

00:01:02.846 --> 00:01:03.606
"Devil's Dog".

00:01:12.430 --> 00:01:13.349
Throughout the year,

00:01:14.230 --> 00:01:17.972
Gilles Lajun walks through the woods in search of memories.

00:01:22.334 --> 00:01:23.575
