00:03:02.579 --> 00:03:03.441
So this is new to me,

00:03:03.941 --> 00:03:05.542
even though we have the American monument next door,

00:03:05.682 --> 00:03:06.342
That's right, I hadn't thought of that.

00:03:06.343 --> 00:03:07.084
Anyway, 9 years ago,

00:03:07.503 --> 00:03:08.424
I hadn't been up there yet,

00:03:09.025 --> 00:03:09.545
