00:03:43.933 --> 00:03:45.054
We didn't have significant resources,

00:03:45.153 --> 00:03:47.254
We were a family who lived very modestly and all that.

00:03:47.795 --> 00:03:51.717
And we crossed Paris with a rifle wrapped in newspaper.

00:03:52.358 --> 00:03:54.418
We need to imagine what that would be like now, in our time.

00:03:55.079 --> 00:03:57.340
