00:50:53.748 --> 00:50:56.010
to have a more common life.

00:50:59.192 --> 00:50:59.453
But anyway,

00:50:59.493 --> 00:51:00.173
I have no regrets.

00:51:01.074 --> 00:51:01.594
It's a mission,

00:51:02.595 --> 00:51:03.756
